function p3TeamPlanDigest(){const t0=todayDate();const days={},changes={};for(let i=-7;i<=21;i++){const d=addD(t0,i),k=iso(d);const p=planFor(d);if(!p||p.pre)continue;const dd=D()[k]||{};
    let ty=p.type;if(i<=0&&p3Replaced(k))ty='O';else if(dd.trainIntent==='no'&&!L()[k]&&p.type!=='R')ty='skip';days[k]=ty;
    if(p.adj&&p.adj.was&&p.adj.was!==p.type)changes[k]={was:p.adj.was,type:p.type,note:String(p.adj.note||'').slice(0,80)}}
  const k=iso(t0),d=D()[k]||{};let koach=null;try{const v=rVerdict(readiness(d),d);if(v)koach=[v[1],v[2]]}catch(e){}
  return {days,changes,koach,koachDay:k}}
function p3TeamPlanSync(){if(sampleMode||!sb||!UID)return;if(TEAM.list==null){if(!TEAM.loading)teamLoad();return}
  if(!TEAM.list.some(m=>m.role!=='coach'&&m.share))return;const dg=p3TeamPlanDigest();const js=JSON.stringify(dg);if(js===P3TP.last)return;
  const cur=meta.teamplan?JSON.stringify({days:meta.teamplan.days,changes:meta.teamplan.changes,koach:meta.teamplan.koach,koachDay:meta.teamplan.koachDay}):'';P3TP.last=js;if(cur===js)return;
  persistMeta('teamplan',{...dg,at:new Date().toISOString()})}
render=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);clearTimeout(P3TP.t);P3TP.t=setTimeout(()=>{try{p3TeamPlanSync()}catch(e){}},4000)}})(render);

// ================= P3 (25 Nov): drinks and food are one list. Log in either, counted once =================
const P3DRK=/coffee|latte|cappuccino|flat white|americano|\btea\b|mocha|espresso|macchiato|cortado|hot chocolate|cocoa|juice|smoothie|\bmilk\b|kefir|shake|cola|coke|\bsoda\b|squash|cordial|kombucha|energy drink|lucozade|isotonic|electrolyte|\bwater\b|beer|lager|stout|\bpint\b|wine|cider|whiske?y|\bgin\b|vodka|\brum\b|prosecco|cocktail/i;
const P3DRKNOT=/porridge|oats|cereal|muesli|granola|sauce|curry|cake|biscuit|bread|pudding|ice cream|yog|pancake|rice|chia|overnight/i;
const P3ALC=/beer|lager|stout|\bpint\b|wine|cider|whiske?y|\bgin\b|vodka|\brum\b|prosecco|cocktail/i;
function p3IsDrink(it){if(!it)return false;if(it.src==='coffee'||it.src==='alcohol'||it.drink)return true;const n=String(it.name||'');if(P3DRKNOT.test(n))return false;return P3DRK.test(n)}
function p3IsAlc(it){return !!it&&(it.src==='alcohol'||(+it.sd||0)>0||P3ALC.test(it.name||''))}
function p3DrinkMl(it){const s=`${it.qty||''} ${it.name||''}`.toLowerCase();const m=s.match(/(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)\s*ml\b/);const l=s.match(/(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)\s*(l|litre|liter)s?\b/);
  const c=String(it.qty||'').toLowerCase().match(/^(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)\s*(x\b|cups?|mugs?|glass(?:es)?|pints?|cans?|bottles?|shots?)/);const n=c?+c[1]:1;
  if(m)return Math.round(+m[1]);if(l)return Math.round(+l[1]*1000);
  const ml=/espresso/.test(s)?(/double/.test(s)?60:30):/\bpint/.test(s)?568:/\bcan\b|cans\b/.test(s)?330:/bottle/.test(s)?500:/wine|prosecco/.test(s)?175:/\bshot|whiske?y|\bgin\b|vodka|\brum\b/.test(s)?35:/\bmug/.test(s)?300:/glass/.test(s)?200:/coffee|latte|cappuccino|flat white|americano|\btea\b|mocha|chocolate|macchiato|cortado/.test(s)?(/small/.test(s)?180:/large/.test(s)?350:250):250;
  return Math.round(ml*n)}
// total drinks for the day: water + every non-alcoholic drink logged anywhere (alcohol is listed but not counted as fluid)
function p3Fluid(d){d=d||{};const w=+d.water||0;let o=0;(d.food||[]).forEach(it=>{if(p3IsDrink(it)&&!p3IsAlc(it)&&!/\bwater\b/i.test(it.name||''))o+=p3DrinkMl(it)*((+it.pct||100)/100)});
  return {w,o:Math.round(o)/1000,t:Math.round((w+o/1000)*100)/100}}
const P3DBASE=['espresso','americano','flat white','latte','cappuccino','mocha','macchiato','cortado','green tea','herbal','hot chocolate','decaf','energy','tea','coffee'];
function p3Base(n){n=String(n||'').toLowerCase();const b=P3DBASE.find(x=>n.includes(x));if(b)return b;return p3IsDrink({name:n})?n.replace(/^(\d+\s*)?(small|medium|large|single|double)\s+/,'').split(/ with |,|\(/)[0].trim():null}
function p3DupOf(k,it){if(!it||p3IsAlc(it))return null;const b=p3Base(it.name);if(!b)return null;const at=it.at?p1Min(it.at):null;
  return ((D()[k]||{}).food||[]).find(x=>p3IsDrink(x)&&!p3IsAlc(x)&&p3Base(x.name)===b&&(at!=null&&x.at?Math.abs(p1Min(x.at)-at)<=45:!!(x.meal&&it.meal&&x.meal===it.meal)))||null}
let P3DC={key:null,t:0},P3SKIP=false;
function p3DupGate(k,it){const d=p3DupOf(k,it);if(!d)return true;const key=p3Base(it.name)+'|'+k+'|'+(d.at||'');
  if(P3DC.key===key&&Date.now()-P3DC.t<8000){P3DC={key:null,t:0};return true}
  P3DC={key,t:Date.now()};toast(`You already have ${String(d.name).toLowerCase()} at ${d.at||d.meal}. Tap again to add a second one.`,4500);return false}
// logging from the Drinks sheet: check the food list first (window capture runs before the sheet's own handlers)
window.addEventListener('click',e=>{const t=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('#cofLog,[data-p3us]');if(!t||!document.getElementById('p1Host'))return;const k=iso(todayDate());let it;
  if(t.id==='cofLog'){it=p1CofItem();if(!it)return;it.at=P1C.at||p1Now()}else{const x=P3US[+t.dataset.p3us];if(!x)return;it={...x,at:P1C.at||p1Now()}}
  it.meal=p1MealFor(it.at);if(!p3DupGate(k,it)){e.stopImmediatePropagation();e.preventDefault();return}P3SKIP=true;setTimeout(()=>{P3SKIP=false},1500)},true);
// logging from Food: a coffee or tea already logged in Drinks at about the same time isn't added again
addFood=(function(old){return async function(items,k){k=k||iso(sel);if(P3SKIP){P3SKIP=false;return old.call(this,items,k)}
  const keep=[],skip=[];(items||[]).forEach(it=>{const m=it.meal||(it.at?p1MealFor(it.at):null);const d=p3IsDrink(it)?p3DupOf(k,{...it,meal:m}):null;if(d&&d.src==='coffee'&&!skip.some(s=>s[1]===d))skip.push([it,d]);else keep.push(it)});
  if(skip.length)toast(`${skip.map(([,d])=>`${d.name} at ${d.at||d.meal}`).join(', ')} ${skip.length>1?'are':'is'} already in your drinks, so ${skip.length>1?'they weren\'t':'it wasn\'t'} added twice.`,5500);
  if(!keep.length){render();return}return old.call(this,keep,k)}})(addFood);
// the Drinks sheet lists every drink in the food log, and the water figure is the day's total
p1CafToday=(function(old){return function(k){const r=old(k);const d=D()[k]||{};r.its=(d.food||[]).map((x,ix)=>({...x,ix})).filter(x=>p3IsDrink(x)&&!p3IsAlc(x));return r}})(p1CafToday);
p1DrinksDraw=(function(old){return function(){old();const host=document.querySelector('#p1Host .ksheet');if(!host)return;const k=iso(todayDate());const f=p3Fluid(D()[k]);
  const wb=host.querySelector('.p1wbig');if(wb&&!host.querySelector('.p3fsplit'))wb.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',`<div class="p3fsplit ds"><span>${ico('droplet')} Water <b class="num">${Math.round(f.w*100)/100} L</b></span><span>${ico('coffee')} Other drinks <b class="num">${f.o} L</b></span></div>`);
  if(!(f.w>0)){const tk=host.querySelector('[data-p1w="-0.25"]');if(tk)tk.remove()}const sp=wb&&wb.querySelector('span');if(sp&&!/total/.test(sp.textContent))sp.textContent=sp.textContent.replace(/^of/,'L in total, of');
  const box=host.querySelector('.p1caf');if(box&&!box.querySelector('.p3once'))box.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<p class="p3once ds">${ico('check')} These are in your Food log too. Calories and caffeine count once.</p>`);
  const hd=host.querySelector('.p1cafh');if(hd&&!/drink/.test(hd.textContent)){const n=(p1CafToday(k).its||[]).length;hd.insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',`<b class="num">${n}</b> drink${n===1?'':'s'} · `)}}})(p1DrinksDraw);
// Food page: a Drinks card so drinks logged in the Drinks sheet are easy to see in the food log
function p3FoodDrinksHTML(k){const d=D()[k]||{};const its=(d.food||[]).map((x,ix)=>({...x,ix})).filter(p3IsDrink);const f=p3Fluid(d);let tg=null;try{tg=p1WaterTarget().lo}catch(e){}
  if(!its.length&&!f.w)return '';const caf=its.reduce((a,x)=>a+(+x.caffeine||0),0),kc=its.reduce((a,x)=>a+(+kcalOf(x)||0),0);
  return `<article class="card p3fdr"><div class="p3fdrh"><b>${ico('coffee')} Drinks</b><span class="num">${f.t} L${tg&&k===iso(todayDate())?` of ${tg} L`:''}</span><button type="button" class="linkbtn" data-p3ring="drinks">Open</button></div>
    <div class="p3fdrs ds num">Water ${Math.round(f.w*100)/100} L · other drinks ${f.o} L${caf?` · ${Math.round(caf)} mg caffeine`:''}${kc?` · ${Math.round(kc)} kcal`:''}</div>
    ${its.length?`<div class="p3fdrl">${its.sort((a,b)=>String(a.at||'').localeCompare(String(b.at||''))).map(x=>`<div class="p3fdri"><span class="num">${esc(x.at||x.meal||'')}</span><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><small class="num">${p3IsAlc(x)?`${+x.sd||''} std`:`${p3DrinkMl(x)} ml`}</small></div>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
    <p class="ds p3once">${ico('check')} Already inside the meal totals above, counted once.</p></article>`}
p3FoodMode=(function(old){return function(){old();try{if(tab()!=='food'||fView!=='today'||(P3FT.open||'tot')!=='tot')return;const app=document.getElementById('app');if(!app||app.querySelector('.p3fdr'))return;
  const h=p3FoodDrinksHTML(iso(sel));if(!h)return;const meals=app.querySelector('article.p1meals')||app.querySelector('.p1plants');if(meals)meals.insertAdjacentHTML(meals.classList.contains('p1plants')?'beforebegin':'afterend',h)}catch(e){}}})(p3FoodMode);

// ================= P3 (25 Nov): fewer taps, no keyboard. Wheels, quick check-in, sets for plan strength, last time from the account, wearables =================
// ---- scroll wheel: one column you flick, snaps to a value. Writes to a hidden input or calls back ----
const P3WH={};
function p3WheelHTML(id,vals,cur,fmt,opt){opt=opt||{};fmt=fmt||(v=>String(v));let i=vals.findIndex(v=>String(v)===String(cur));const unset=i<0;if(unset)i=Math.max(0,vals.findIndex(v=>String(v)===String(opt.def)));if(i<0)i=Math.floor(vals.length/2);
  P3WH[id]={vals,i,unset,cb:opt.cb||null,input:opt.input||null};
  return `<div class="kwh${unset?' unset':''}${opt.cls?' '+opt.cls:''}" data-wh="${esc(id)}" role="listbox" aria-label="${esc(opt.label||id)}" tabindex="0"><div class="kwhsel" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="kwhs">${vals.map((v,j)=>`<div class="kwhi" data-whi="${j}" role="option">${esc(fmt(v))}</div>`).join('')}</div>${opt.unit?`<span class="kwhu">${esc(opt.unit)}</span>`:''}</div>`}
const P3WH_H=40;
function p3WheelInit(root){(root||document).querySelectorAll('.kwh').forEach(w=>{const s=w.querySelector('.kwhs');const st=P3WH[w.dataset.wh];if(!s||!st||s.dataset.init)return;s.dataset.init='1';s.scrollTop=st.i*P3WH_H;let t=null,user=false;
  const pick=j=>{j=Math.max(0,Math.min(st.vals.length-1,j));const ch=j!==st.i||st.unset;st.i=j;st.unset=false;w.classList.remove('unset');s.querySelectorAll('.kwhi').forEach((x,ix)=>x.classList.toggle('on',ix===j));
    if(ch){const v=st.vals[j];if(st.input){const inp=document.getElementById(st.input);if(inp){inp.value=v;inp.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));inp.dispatchEvent(new Event('change',{bubbles:true}))}}if(st.cb)try{st.cb(v)}catch(e){}}};
  s.querySelectorAll('.kwhi').forEach((x,ix)=>x.classList.toggle('on',ix===st.i&&!st.unset));
  s.addEventListener('pointerdown',()=>{user=true},{passive:true});s.addEventListener('touchstart',()=>{user=true},{passive:true});s.addEventListener('wheel',()=>{user=true},{passive:true});
  s.addEventListener('scroll',()=>{if(!user)return;clearTimeout(t);t=setTimeout(()=>pick(Math.round(s.scrollTop/P3WH_H)),110)},{passive:true});
  s.addEventListener('click',e=>{const it=e.target.closest('.kwhi');if(!it)return;const j=+it.dataset.whi;user=true;s.scrollTo({top:j*P3WH_H,behavior:'smooth'});pick(j)});
  w.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='ArrowDown'||e.key==='ArrowUp'){e.preventDefault();const j=st.i+(e.key==='ArrowDown'?1:-1);s.scrollTop=Math.max(0,j)*P3WH_H;pick(j)}})})}
const p3Range=(a,b,st)=>{const o=[];for(let v=a;v<=b+1e-9;v=Math.round((v+st)*100)/100)o.push(v);return o};
const p3Times=(fromMin,toMin,step)=>{const o=[];for(let m=fromMin;m<=toMin;m+=step)o.push(fmtT(((m%1440)+1440)%1440));return o};
const p3MS=(a,b,st)=>{const o=[];for(let s=a;s<=b;s+=st)o.push(`${Math.floor(s/60)}:${String(s%60).padStart(2,'0')}`);return o};
function p3SnapT(t,step){const m=tmin(t);if(m==null)return t;const r=Math.round(m/step)*step;return fmtT(((r%1440)+1440)%1440)}
// any keyboard box in the session log becomes a wheel (the box stays, hidden, so saving works as before)
const P3WHIN={'f-dur':{vals:p3Range(5,240,5),unit:'min',def:45,label:'How long, minutes'},'f-tb':{vals:p3Range(0,300,2.5),unit:'kg',def:60,label:'Top set, kg'},'f-ss':{vals:p3Range(0,250,2.5),unit:'kg',def:40,label:'Second lift, kg'},
  'f-pace':{vals:p3MS(150,540,5),unit:'/km',def:'4:45',label:'Pace per km'},'f-5k':{vals:p3MS(840,2700,5),unit:'',def:'22:00',label:'5 km time'}};
function p3Wheelify(root){root=root||document;Object.keys(P3WHIN).forEach(id=>{const inp=root.querySelector('#'+id);if(!inp||inp.dataset.wh)return;const c=P3WHIN[id];inp.dataset.wh='1';inp.classList.add('p3hidin');inp.setAttribute('tabindex','-1');
  let cur=inp.value;if(id==='f-pace'||id==='f-5k'){const s=toSec(cur);cur=s?`${Math.floor(s/60)}:${String(Math.round(s%60/5)*5%60).padStart(2,'0')}`:''}else if(cur!=='')cur=Math.round(+cur/(id==='f-dur'?5:2.5))*(id==='f-dur'?5:2.5);
  inp.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',p3WheelHTML('in-'+id,c.vals,cur,null,{input:id,unit:c.unit,def:c.def,label:c.label,cls:'kwhin'}));
  if(id==='f-dur'){const ch=root.querySelector('.p3dur');if(ch)ch.querySelectorAll('button[data-p3dur]').forEach(b=>b.remove())}});p3WheelInit(root)}
render=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);try{p3Wheelify(document.getElementById('app'))}catch(e){}}})(render);window.__p3wf=p3Wheelify;

// ---- quick morning check-in: sleep times, how you feel, anything off. Full version one tap away ----
const P3FEEL=[[1,'Rough'],[2,'Flat'],[3,'OK'],[4,'Good'],[5,'Great']];
const P3OFF=[['tired','Tired'],['badsleep','Slept badly'],['stressed','Stressed'],['lowmood','Low mood'],['sore','Sore'],['unwell','Unwell']];
const _p3CiOpen=p1CiOpen;
p1CiOpen=function(){_p3CiOpen.apply(this,arguments);const c=P1.ci;if(!c)return;const d=D()[c.k]||{};c.had=new Set(['sleepQ','energy','mood','stress','sore'].filter(x=>d[x]!=null));c.touched=new Set();
  let qm=true;try{qm=localStorage.getItem('p3cifull')!=='1'}catch(e){}c.quick=qm;c.off=new Set(d.ciOff||[]);c.feel=d.feel||null;
  const prev=Object.values(D()).filter(x=>x&&x.bed&&x.wake&&x.date!==c.k).sort((a,b)=>String(b.date).localeCompare(String(a.date)))[0];c.prevBW=prev?{bed:prev.bed,wake:prev.wake}:null;c.sleepSet=!!(d.bed&&d.wake);
  c.bed=p3SnapT(c.bed,10);c.wake=p3SnapT(c.wake,10);p1CiDraw()};
function p3QuickCiHTML(c){const h=p1SleepCalc(c);const p=planFor(parse(c.k));const planned=!!(p&&p.type!=='R'&&!p.pre);const same=c.prevBW&&c.prevBW.bed===c.bed&&c.prevBW.wake===c.wake;const s=c.sick||{types:[]};
  const sickOn=c.off.has('unwell');
  return `<div class="kshead"><div><h2>Morning check-in</h2><small class="ds">${fmtD(parse(c.k),{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'short'})}</small></div><button type="button" class="x" id="p1X" aria-label="Close">${ico('x')}</button></div>
  <section class="p1blk p3qci"><div class="p3qh"><h3>Last night</h3><b class="num p3qsl">${h!=null&&c.sleepSet?h+' h':'–'}</b></div>
    ${c.prevBW?`<button type="button" class="p3same${same&&c.sleepSet?' on':''}" data-p3same aria-pressed="${!!(same&&c.sleepSet)}">${ico('check')} Same as last night <small class="num">${esc(c.prevBW.bed)} to ${esc(c.prevBW.wake)}</small></button>`:''}
    <div class="p3bw"><div><span class="label">Into bed</span>${p3WheelHTML('ci-bed',p3Times(19*60,27*60,10),c.sleepSet?c.bed:'',null,{def:c.bed,label:'Into bed',cb:v=>{c.bed=v;c.sleepSet=true;p3QciSleep()}})}</div>
      <div><span class="label">Woke for good</span>${p3WheelHTML('ci-wake',p3Times(4*60,12*60,10),c.sleepSet?c.wake:'',null,{def:c.wake,label:'Woke for good',cb:v=>{c.wake=v;c.sleepSet=true;p3QciSleep()}})}</div></div></section>
  <section class="p1blk p3qci"><h3>How do you feel?</h3><div class="p3feel">${P3FEEL.map(([v,l])=>`<button type="button" data-p3feel="${v}" aria-pressed="${+c.feel===v}"><i class="p3fd p3fd${v}"></i><span>${l}</span></button>`).join('')}</div></section>
  <section class="p1blk p3qci"><h3>Anything off? <small class="ds">Skip if not</small></h3><div class="p3off">${P3OFF.map(([v,l])=>`<button type="button" data-p3off="${v}" aria-pressed="${c.off.has(v)}">${l}</button>`).join('')}<a class="p3offn" href="#checkin" id="p1Hurt">${ico('heart-pulse')} Niggle or injury</a></div>
    ${sickOn?`<div class="p1cof p3sickq">${SICK.map(x=>`<button type="button" data-p1sick="${x}" aria-pressed="${(s.types||[]).includes(x)}">${x}</button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}</section>
  ${planned?`<section class="p1blk p3qci"><h3>Today: ${esc(TNAME[p.type])}</h3>${p1Seg('trainIntent',[['yes','Yes, doing it'],['no','Not today']],c.trainIntent)}</section>`:''}
  <button type="button" class="primary p1save" id="p1CiSave" ${c.busy||!c.feel||!c.sleepSet?'disabled':''}>${c.busy?'Saving…':!c.sleepSet?'Set your sleep times':!c.feel?'Pick how you feel':'Done'}</button>
  <button type="button" class="linkbtn p3full" data-p3cifull="1">Full check-in: sleep detail and sliders ›</button>`}
function p3QciSleep(){const c=P1.ci;if(!c)return;const h=p1SleepCalc(c);const b=document.querySelector('.p3qsl');if(b)b.textContent=h!=null?h+' h':'–';const sm=document.querySelector('[data-p3same]');if(sm){const on=c.prevBW&&c.prevBW.bed===c.bed&&c.prevBW.wake===c.wake;sm.classList.toggle('on',!!on);sm.setAttribute('aria-pressed',!!on)}
  const sv=document.getElementById('p1CiSave');if(sv){sv.disabled=!c.feel||!c.sleepSet;sv.textContent=!c.sleepSet?'Set your sleep times':!c.feel?'Pick how you feel':'Done'}setTimeout(p1Queue,0)}
p1CiDraw=(function(old){return function(){const c=P1.ci;if(c&&c.quick){p1Sheet(p3QuickCiHTML(c));p3WheelInit(document.getElementById('p1Host'));return}old.apply(this,arguments);
  if(c&&!c.quick){const host=document.querySelector('#p1Host .ksheet');if(host&&!host.querySelector('[data-p3cifull]')){const sv=host.querySelector('#p1CiSave');if(sv)sv.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend','<button type="button" class="linkbtn p3full" data-p3cifull="0">Quick check-in ›</button>')}
    // bed and wake become wheels here too
    ['bed','wake'].forEach(k=>{const inp=host&&host.querySelector('#p1'+k);if(!inp||inp.dataset.wh)return;inp.dataset.wh='1';inp.classList.add('p3hidin');const vals=k==='bed'?p3Times(19*60,27*60,10):p3Times(4*60,12*60,10);
      inp.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',p3WheelHTML('cif-'+k,vals,p3SnapT(c[k],10),null,{label:k==='bed'?'Into bed':'Woke for good',cb:v=>{c[k]=v;inp.value=v;const h=p1SleepCalc(c);const b=document.querySelector('.p1sleep b');if(b)b.textContent=(h!=null?h:'–')+' h';setTimeout(p1Queue,0)}}))});
    const scr=host&&host.querySelector('#p1scr');if(scr&&!scr.dataset.wh){scr.dataset.wh='1';scr.classList.add('p3hidin');scr.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',p3WheelHTML('cif-scr',['']. concat(p3Times(19*60,27*60,15)),c.screenOff?p3SnapT(c.screenOff,15):'',v=>v||'Not set',{label:'Phone away at',cb:v=>{c.screenOff=v;setTimeout(p1Queue,0)}}))}
    p3WheelInit(host)}}})(p1CiDraw);
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const c=P1.ci;if(!c)return;const q=s=>e.target.closest&&e.target.closest(s);let x;
  if(x=q('[data-p3cifull]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();c.quick=x.dataset.p3cifull!=='1';try{localStorage.setItem('p3cifull',c.quick?'0':'1')}catch(z){}p1CiDraw();return}
  if(!c.quick)return;
  if(q('[data-p3same]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();if(c.prevBW){c.bed=p3SnapT(c.prevBW.bed,10);c.wake=p3SnapT(c.prevBW.wake,10);c.sleepSet=true}p1CiDraw();setTimeout(p1Queue,0);return}
  if(x=q('[data-p3feel]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();c.feel=+x.dataset.p3feel;p1CiDraw();setTimeout(p1Queue,0);return}
  if(x=q('[data-p3off]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();const v=x.dataset.p3off;if(c.off.has(v))c.off.delete(v);else c.off.add(v);if(v==='unwell'&&!c.off.has(v))c.sick={types:[],sev:null,meds:[]};p1CiDraw();setTimeout(p1Queue,0);return}},true);
// slider touched in the full check-in; untouched sliders save nothing
document.addEventListener('input',e=>{const el=e.target;if(el.dataset&&el.dataset.p1sl&&P1.ci&&P1.ci.touched)P1.ci.touched.add(el.dataset.p1sl)},true);
p1CiFields=(function(old){return function(c){const f=old(c);
  if(c.quick){['latency','wakes','awakeMin'].forEach(k=>delete f[k]);if(!c.sleepSet){delete f.bed;delete f.wake;delete f.sleepH}
    if(!c.feel){['sleepQ','energy','mood','stress','sore'].forEach(k=>delete f[k]);return f}
    const v=+c.feel,o=c.off;f.feel=v;f.ciOff=[...o];f.ciQuick=true;
    f.energy=o.has('tired')?Math.min(v,2):v;f.mood=o.has('lowmood')?Math.min(v,2):v;f.sleepQ=o.has('badsleep')?Math.min(v,2):Math.max(2,Math.min(5,v));f.stress=o.has('stressed')?4:Math.max(1,3-Math.max(0,v-3));f.sore=o.has('sore')?4:2;
    if(!o.has('unwell'))f.sick=null;return f}
  if(c.touched){['sleepQ','energy','mood','stress','sore'].forEach(k=>{if(!c.touched.has(k)&&!(c.had&&c.had.has(k)))delete f[k]})}return f}})(p1CiFields);
p1CiSave=(function(old){return async function(){const c=P1.ci;if(c&&c.quick&&(!c.feel||!c.sleepSet)){toast(!c.sleepSet?'Set your sleep times first':'Pick how you feel first');return}return old.apply(this,arguments)}})(p1CiSave);

// ---- session log: one tap "Done as planned", and one feedback question at a time ----
function p3PlanMin(pl){if(!pl)return 45;const wi=pl.wk-1;const t=pl.type;if(t==='E')return (+EASY[wi]||30)+15;if(t==='S')return 60;if(t==='T')return 50;if(t==='X')return 70;if(t==='H')return 60;return 45}
render=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);try{const f=document.getElementById('logForm');if(!f||f.querySelector('.p3dap'))return;const st=f.querySelector('[data-bind="s.status"],.seg');
  const k=sOpenK||iso(sel);const pl=planFor(parse(k));if(!pl||pl.type==='R')return;const h3=f.querySelector('h3');if(!h3)return;
  h3.parentElement.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',`<button type="button" class="p3dap" data-p3dap="${p3PlanMin(pl)}">${ico('check')} Done as planned <small>${p3PlanMin(pl)} min · then just say how hard</small></button>`)}catch(e){}}})(render);
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('[data-p3dap]');if(!b)return;e.preventDefault();const f=document.getElementById('logForm');if(!f)return;
  const done=f.querySelector('[data-k="status"][data-v="done"],[data-v="done"]');if(done)done.click();setTimeout(()=>{const inp=document.getElementById('f-dur');if(inp){inp.value=b.dataset.p3dap;inp.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}))}
    const w=document.querySelector('[data-wh="in-f-dur"]');if(w&&P3WH['in-f-dur']){const st=P3WH['in-f-dur'];const j=st.vals.findIndex(v=>+v===+b.dataset.p3dap);if(j>=0){st.i=j;st.unset=false;w.classList.remove('unset');const s=w.querySelector('.kwhs');s.scrollTop=j*P3WH_H;s.querySelectorAll('.kwhi').forEach((x,ix)=>x.classList.toggle('on',ix===j))}}
    const r=document.getElementById('f-rpe');if(r)r.scrollIntoView({block:'center',behavior:'smooth'});toast('Marked done. Now slide how hard it was.')},60)});
// feedback: overall plus one question, rotating, with the rest one tap away
p2FbDraw=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);const f=P2FB&&P2FB.f;if(!f||f.all)return;const host=document.querySelector('#p1Host .ksheet');if(!host)return;
  const fs=[...host.querySelectorAll('.field')].filter(x=>x.querySelector('[data-p2fq]')&&!x.querySelector('[data-p2fq="feel"]'));if(fs.length<2)return;
  const n=Math.floor(Date.now()/864e5);const keep=fs.find(x=>x.querySelector('[data-p2fq]')&&FB_Q.findIndex(q=>q[0]===x.querySelector('[data-p2fq]').dataset.p2fq)===n%FB_Q.length)||fs[0];
  fs.forEach(x=>{if(x!==keep&&!x.querySelector('[aria-pressed="true"]'))x.classList.add('p3hide')});const note=host.querySelector('#p2FbNote');const nf=note&&note.closest('.field');if(nf&&!note.value)nf.classList.add('p3hide');
  if(!host.querySelector('[data-p3fball]'))keep.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend','<button type="button" class="linkbtn" data-p3fball>More questions ›</button>')}})(p2FbDraw);
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(!(e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('[data-p3fball]')))return;if(P2FB&&P2FB.f){P2FB.f.all=true;p2FbDraw()}});

// ---- strength in your own plan: a workout that logs every set, like a coach's programme ----
const p3Slug=s=>String(s||'').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,'-').replace(/^-|-$/g,'');
function p3ParseDose(dose){const s=String(dose||'');const m=s.match(/^\s*(\d+)\s*[×x]\s*([^·@]+?)\s*(?:[·@]\s*(.+))?$/);if(!m)return {sets:3,reps:s,load:''};return {sets:+m[1],reps:m[2].trim(),load:(m[3]||'').trim()}}
function p3PlanWorkout(k){const pl=planFor(parse(k));if(!pl||pl.type!=='S')return null;const p=pl.p;
  const ex=[],items=[];STRENGTH.forEach(e=>{const nm=Array.isArray(e.nm)?e.nm[p]:e.nm;if(!nm)return;const id='p:'+p3Slug(nm);const d=p3ParseDose(e.d[p]);const dist=/\d\s*m\b/.test(d.reps);
    ex.push({id,name:nm,cues:e.cue||''});items.push({ex:id,sets:DELOAD[pl.wk]?Math.min(2,d.sets):d.sets,reps:d.reps,load:dist?'':d.load,note:dist&&d.load?'@ '+d.load:'',rest:/rest\s*([\d\-–]+\s*min)/i.test(e.cue||'')?(e.cue.match(/rest\s*([\d\-–]+\s*min)/i)[1]):''})});
  return {assignment:'plan:'+k,plan:true,team_id:null,team:'',start:k,load:100,note:'',programme:{name:'Your Keel plan',plan:{weeks:[{days:[{dow:0,title:TNAME.S,min:60,rpe:7,items}]}]}},exercises:ex,logs:[]}}
function p3PWOpen(k){const a=p3PlanWorkout(k);if(!a)return;let saved=null;try{saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(p3WKey(a.assignment,k))||'null')}catch(e){}
  const d=a.programme.plan.weeks[0].days[0];const lg=L()[k];
  const sets=saved&&saved.sets||d.items.map(it=>{const prev=lg&&lg.sets&&lg.sets.find(r=>r.ex===it.ex);if(prev&&prev.done&&prev.done.length)return prev.done.map(s=>({kg:s.kg,reps:s.reps,done:true}));const n=+it.sets||3;const kg=p3WKg(it.load,it.ex);const reps=p3WReps(it.reps);return Array.from({length:n},()=>({kg,reps,done:false}))});
  Object.assign(P3W,{on:true,aid:a.assignment,k,a,d,t:{wk:planFor(parse(k)).wk,dow:0,days:[d]},items:d.items,sets,i:saved?saved.i:0,t0:saved&&saved.t0||Date.now(),fin:false,rpe:(lg&&lg.rpe)||7,note:''});p3WDraw();try{p3Wake(true)}catch(e){}}
window.addEventListener('click',async e=>{const b=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('[data-p3pw]');if(b){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();p3PWOpen(b.dataset.p3pw);return}
  if(!(e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('#p3wSave'))||!P3W.on||!P3W.a||!P3W.a.plan)return;e.stopImmediatePropagation();
  const {a,k,items,sets}=P3W;const n=document.getElementById('p3wNote');const note=n?n.value.trim():'';const dur=Math.max(5,Math.min(240,Math.round((Date.now()-P3W.t0)/60000)));
  const rows=items.map((it,i)=>{const e2=(a.exercises||[]).find(z=>z.id===it.ex)||{};return {ex:it.ex,name:e2.name||'',target:{sets:it.sets,reps:it.reps,load:it.load},done:sets[i].filter(s=>s.done).map(s=>({kg:+s.kg,reps:+s.reps}))}});
  const pl=planFor(parse(k));const doc={...(L()[k]||{}),date:k,status:'done',dur,rpe:P3W.rpe,notes:note||(L()[k]||{}).notes||'',sets:rows,wk:pl.wk,slot:'S',type:'S',savedAt:new Date().toISOString()};
  const tb=rows.find(r=>/deadlift|squat/i.test(r.name)&&r.done.length);if(tb)doc.tb=Math.max(...tb.done.map(s=>s.kg));
  logs[k]=doc;if(logsCol){try{await logsCol.doc(k).set(doc)}catch(z){toast('Could not save. Try again.');return}}
  try{localStorage.removeItem(p3WKey(a.assignment,k))}catch(z){}P3W.on=false;try{p3Wake(false)}catch(z){}p1Sheet(null);p3LastBuild();toast('Saved. Every set is in your log.',3500);render()},true);
sessionHTML=(function(old){return function(d,pl){let h=old(d,pl);try{if(pl&&pl.type==='S'){const k=iso(d);const lg=L()[k];const n=lg&&lg.sets?lg.sets.reduce((a,r)=>a+(r.done||[]).length,0):0;
  const btn=`<button type="button" class="primary p3pwbtn" data-p3pw="${k}">${ico('play')} ${n?`Workout logged · ${n} sets. Open it`:'Start workout · log your sets'}</button>`;
  const i=h.indexOf('<div class="ex">');h=i>0?h.slice(0,i)+btn+h.slice(i):h+btn}}catch(e){}return h}})(sessionHTML);
// one tick per exercise: all the sets, as shown
p3WDraw=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);if(!P3W.on||P3W.fin)return;const host=document.querySelector('#p1Host .ksheet');if(!host)return;const ss=P3W.sets[P3W.i]||[];const left=ss.filter(s=>!s.done).length;
  if(left>=2&&!host.querySelector('[data-p3wall]')){const s0=ss.find(z=>!z.done);const it0=P3W.items[P3W.i];if(p3WKind(it0,(P3W.a.exercises||[]).find(z=>z.id===it0.ex))==='weight'&&!(+s0.kg>0))return;const sec=host.querySelector('.p3wex');const s=ss.find(z=>!z.done);const it=P3W.items[P3W.i];const kind=p3WKind(it,(P3W.a.exercises||[]).find(z=>z.id===it.ex));
    if(sec)sec.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<button type="button" class="ghost p3wallb" data-p3wall>${ico('check')} All ${left} sets done${kind==='weight'&&s?` at ${s.kg} kg × ${s.reps}`:''}</button>`)}}})(p3WDraw);
window.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(!(e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('[data-p3wall]'))||!P3W.on)return;e.stopImmediatePropagation();const ss=P3W.sets[P3W.i];const f=ss.find(z=>!z.done);ss.forEach(s=>{if(!s.done){s.kg=f.kg;s.reps=f.reps;s.done=true}});
  try{clearInterval(P3T.t);P3T.end=0}catch(z){}p3WSave();if(P3W.i<P3W.items.length-1)P3W.i++;else P3W.fin=true;p3WSave();p3WDraw()},true);
// next weight: from last time's kg, reps and how hard it felt (RPE). A suggestion only: tap Use, or change it on the slider
const r25=v=>Math.round(v/2.5)*2.5;
function p3NextKg(last,it){const kg=+last.kg,r=last.rpe,tr=p3WReps(it.reps),met=+last.reps>=tr;if(!(kg>0))return null;
  if(r==null)return {kg,why:'No effort rating last time, so start at the same weight.'};
  if(r<=6)return {kg:kg+(kg>=60?5:2.5),why:`Felt easy last time (RPE ${r}), so add ${kg>=60?5:2.5} kg.`};
  if(r<=8)return met?{kg:kg+2.5,why:`RPE ${r} and you hit your reps, so add 2.5 kg.`}:{kg,why:`RPE ${r} but reps came up short, so stay at ${kg} kg.`};
  return met?{kg,why:`Very hard last time (RPE ${r}), so hold at ${kg} kg.`}:{kg:Math.max(0,kg-Math.max(2.5,r25(kg*.05))),why:`Very hard and reps came up short (RPE ${r}), so drop ${Math.max(2.5,r25(kg*.05))} kg.`}}
function p3NextHTML(last,it,ss){const n=p3NextKg(last,it);const lt=`Last time: ${last.kg} kg × ${last.reps}${last.rpe!=null?` · RPE ${last.rpe}`:''}`;if(!n)return `<div class="p3wlast">${lt}</div>`;
  const cur=ss.find(s=>!s.done);const using=cur&&+cur.kg===n.kg;
  return `<div class="p3wnext"><div class="p3wlast" style="margin:0">${lt}</div><div class="p3wnxr"><div><b>Next: ${n.kg} kg</b><small>${esc(n.why)}</small></div>${cur?(using?`<span class="p3wnxok">${ico('check')} Using</span>`:`<button type="button" class="p3wnxb" data-p3wnext="${n.kg}">Use</button>`):''}</div></div>`}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const x=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('[data-p3wnext]');if(!x||!P3W.on)return;e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();const kg=+x.dataset.p3wnext;(P3W.sets[P3W.i]||[]).forEach(s=>{if(!s.done)s.kg=kg});p3WSave();p3WDraw()},true);
(function(){const st=document.createElement('style');st.textContent=`.p3wnext{margin:10px 0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}.p3wnxr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:6px}.p3wnxr>div{flex:1}.p3wnxr b{display:block;font-size:16px}.p3wnxr small{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.35}
.p3wnxb{min-height:40px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:99px;border:0;background:var(--k-amber);color:#15171E;font:600 14px/1 var(--font-body)}.p3wnxok{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;color:var(--ok);font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.p3wnxok .ki,.p3wnxok svg{width:16px;height:16px}`;document.head.appendChild(st)})();
// "last time" comes from your saved sessions (own plan and team programmes), not just this phone
let P3LAST={};
function p3LastBuild(){const m={};const add=(ex,day,arr,rpe)=>{if(!ex||!arr||!arr.length)return;const top=arr.reduce((a,s)=>(+s.kg>+a.kg||(+s.kg===+a.kg&&+s.reps>+a.reps))?s:a,arr[0]);if(!m[ex]||m[ex].day<day)m[ex]={kg:+top.kg,reps:+top.reps,day,rpe:isNum(+rpe)&&+rpe>0?+rpe:null}};
  Object.values(L()).forEach(l=>{if(l&&l.sets)l.sets.forEach(r=>add(r.ex,l.date,r.done,r.rpe||l.rpe))});(P3LAST._sc||[]).forEach(r=>(r.sets||[]).forEach(x=>add(x.ex,r.day,x.done,x.rpe||r.rpe)));m._sc=P3LAST._sc;P3LAST=m}
async function p3LastLoad(){if(!sb||!UID)return;try{const {data}=await sb.from('sc_logs').select('day,sets,rpe').eq('player_id',UID).gte('day',iso(addD(todayDate(),-180)));P3LAST._sc=data||[]}catch(e){}p3LastBuild()}
p3WLast=(function(old){return function(id){if(!P3LAST._b){P3LAST._b=1;p3LastBuild()}const s=P3LAST[id];if(s)return {kg:s.kg,reps:s.reps,rpe:s.rpe,day:s.day};return old(id)}})(p3WLast);
mypLoad=(function(old){return async function(){await old.apply(this,arguments);p3LastLoad()}})(mypLoad);

// ---- wearables: pair a device. Saved to your account so staff know who wears what; live data switches on when the connection is set up ----
const P3WEAR=[['garmin','Garmin','cloud'],['whoop','WHOOP','cloud'],['oura','Oura Ring','cloud'],['polar','Polar','cloud'],['fitbit','Fitbit','cloud'],['coros','COROS','cloud'],['suunto','Suunto','cloud'],['apple','Apple Watch','phone'],['samsung','Samsung Galaxy Watch','phone'],['keel','Keel band','keel'],['none','I don\'t wear one','none']];
const p3Wear=()=>(meta.wearable&&meta.wearable.device)?meta.wearable:null;
function p3WearCardHTML(){const w=p3Wear();const d=w&&P3WEAR.find(x=>x[0]===w.device);const live=!!(window.P3CFG&&P3CFG.wearables);
  return `<article class="card p3wear"><div class="p3wearh"><span class="p3weari">${ico('activity')}</span><div><b>Wearable</b><small class="ds">${d?(d[0]==='none'?'None paired':`${esc(d[1])} · ${w.status==='live'?'syncing':'paired, waiting to connect'}`):'Pair a watch or ring so sleep, heart rate and sessions fill in themselves'}</small></div>
    <button type="button" class="${d&&d[0]!=='none'?'ghost':'primary'} p3wearb" data-p3wear>${d&&d[0]!=='none'?'Change':'Pair'}</button></div></article>`}
function p3WearSheet(){const w=p3Wear();const live=!!(window.P3CFG&&P3CFG.wearables);
  p1Sheet(`<div class="kshead"><div><h2>Pair a wearable</h2><small class="ds">Sleep, heart rate, HRV and sessions come in by themselves</small></div><button type="button" class="x" id="p1X" aria-label="Close">${ico('x')}</button></div>
    <div class="p3wl">${P3WEAR.map(([id,nm,kind])=>`<button type="button" class="p3wli" data-p3wpick="${id}" aria-pressed="${w&&w.device===id}"><b>${esc(nm)}</b><small>${kind==='cloud'?(live?'Sign in to connect':'Connection being tested'):kind==='phone'?'Needs the Keel phone app (coming)':kind==='keel'?'Ask your coach or club':''}</small></button>`).join('')}</div>
    <section class="p1blk"><h3>What it fills in</h3><ul class="p3wlist"><li>Bed and wake times, sleep and waking in the night</li><li>Resting heart rate and HRV, an early warning when you're run down</li><li>Sessions: start, length and heart-rate effort</li></ul><p class="ds">You'd still tell Keel how you feel, anything sore, and how hard a session felt.</p></section>`)}
document.addEventListener('click',async e=>{const q=s=>e.target.closest&&e.target.closest(s);let x;
  if(q('[data-p3wear]')){p3WearSheet();return}
  if(x=q('[data-p3wpick]')){const id=x.dataset.p3wpick;const live=!!(window.P3CFG&&P3CFG.wearables);const kind=(P3WEAR.find(z=>z[0]===id)||[])[2];
    if(live&&kind==='cloud'){try{const r=await fetch('/api/wearable?device='+encodeURIComponent(id)+'&uid='+encodeURIComponent(UID||''));const j=await r.json();if(j&&j.url){await persistMeta('wearable',{device:id,status:'pending',at:new Date().toISOString()});location.href=j.url;return}}catch(z){}}
    if(await persistMeta('wearable',{device:id,status:id==='none'?'none':'paired',at:new Date().toISOString()}))toast(id==='none'?'Noted. You can pair one any time.':`${(P3WEAR.find(z=>z[0]===id)||[])[1]} saved. We'll switch on the live connection when it's ready.`,4500);p1Sheet(null);render()}});
// card on the You page, under the team card
render=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);try{if(tab()!=='profile')return;const app=document.getElementById('app');if(!app||app.querySelector('.p3wear'))return;const anchor=app.querySelector('.p3team,article.card');if(anchor)anchor.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',p3WearCardHTML());else app.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',p3WearCardHTML())}catch(e){}}})(render);

// ================= P3 (25 Nov pm): tidier Drinks, Food rows for drinks and plants, header down to 3, session tidy =================
// drinks total counts the water you mix shakes and electrolytes with (assumed: 300 ml a protein scoop, 500 ml an electrolyte tablet)
function p3SuppMl(d){let ml=0;try{supps().forEach(s=>{if(!p3Took(d,s))return;const t=`${s.name||''} ${s.dose||''}`.toLowerCase();const q=p3SQ(d,s.id);
  if(/electrolyte|hydro|hydration|rehydrat|oral rehydration|nuun|dioralyte/.test(t))ml+=500*q;else if(/protein|whey|shake|mass gainer|recovery drink|casein/.test(t))ml+=300*q})}catch(e){}return ml}
p3Fluid=(function(old){return function(d){const r=old(d);const s=p3SuppMl(d||{})/1000;r.s=Math.round(s*100)/100;r.t=Math.round((r.t+s)*100)/100;return r}})(p3Fluid);
let p3Bar=(pct,col)=>`<div class="kfbar"><i style="width:${Math.max(0,Math.min(100,pct))}%;background:${col}"></i></div>`;
const p3Chev=()=>'<svg class="p3chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>';
// ---- the Drinks sheet, rebuilt tight: water always open, coffee/tea and alcohol fold with a summary ----
const P3DS={cof:null,alc:false,fav:false,other:false};
p1DrinksDraw=function(){const k=iso(todayDate());const d=D()[k]||{};const f=p3Fluid(d);const tg=p1WaterTarget();const pct=Math.round(f.t/tg.lo*100);
  const cf=p1CafToday(k);const it=p1CofItem();const c=COFFEE.find(x=>x[0]===P1C.type);const noMilk=c&&/energy|espresso|herbal|green/.test(c[0]);
  const fv=dFavs();const us=fv.length?fv:p3Usuals();P3US=us;const n=cf.its.length;const cofOpen=P3DS.cof!=null?P3DS.cof:!!P1C.type;const showB=P3DS.other||!!P1C.type;
  const alcT=(d.food||[]).filter(p3IsAlc);const sdT=Math.round(alcT.reduce((a,x)=>a+(+x.sd||0),0)*10)/10;let wk=0,lim=0;try{wk=alcWeek(k);lim=alcLimit()}catch(e){}
  const keys=new Set(fv.map(x=>String(x.name).toLowerCase()));const ago=P1C.at?Math.round((p1Min(p1Now())-p1Min(P1C.at))/30)*30:0;
  const when=`<div class="p3dwhen"><span>Had it</span>${[[0,'Now'],[30,'30m'],[60,'1h'],[120,'2h'],[180,'3h']].map(([m,l])=>`<button type="button" data-p3when="${m}" aria-pressed="${ago===m}">${l}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;
  p1Sheet(`<div class="kshead"><div><h2>Drinks</h2><small class="ds">Today</small></div><button type="button" class="x" id="p1X" aria-label="Close">${ico('x')}</button></div>
  <section class="p1blk p3dw"><div class="p3dwh"><span class="p3dwt">${ico('droplet')} Water</span><b class="num">${f.t}<small> of ${tg.lo} L</small></b><b class="num p3dwp">${pct}%</b></div>
    ${p3Bar(pct,'var(--k-sky,#4ea3d9)')}
    <div class="p3dws">Water ${Math.round(f.w*100)/100} L · tea, coffee and other drinks ${f.o} L${f.s?` · shakes ${f.s} L`:''}${tg.why.length?` · more today: ${esc(tg.why.join(', '))}`:''}</div>
    <div class="p3dwb">${f.w>0?`<button type="button" class="p3dwm" data-p1w="-0.25" aria-label="Take off 250 ml">−</button>`:''}${[[.25,'250 ml','Glass'],[.5,'500 ml','Small bottle'],[.75,'750 ml','Bottle'],[1,'1 L','Litre']].map(([v,ml,l])=>`<button type="button" data-p1w="${v}"><b>+${ml}</b><small>${l}</small></button>`).join('')}</div></section>
  <section class="p1blk p3dsec${cofOpen?' open':''}"><button type="button" class="p3dsh" data-p3dsec="cof" aria-expanded="${cofOpen}">${ico('coffee')}<b>Coffee and tea</b><small class="num">${n?`${n} today · ${cf.tot} mg${cf.last?` · last ${esc(cf.last)}`:''}`:'None today'}</small>${p3Chev()}</button>
    ${cofOpen?`<div class="p3dbody">
      ${n?`<div class="p3dlist">${cf.its.map(x=>`<div class="p1cafi p3dli"><span class="num">${esc(x.at||'')}</span><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><button type="button" class="p3dstar${keys.has(String(x.name).toLowerCase())?' on':''}" data-p3dfav="${x.ix}" aria-label="Favourite">${ico('star')}</button><button type="button" class="x" data-del-food="${x.ix}" data-p1redraw aria-label="Remove">${ico('x')}</button></div>`).join('')}
        ${cf.last&&p1Min(cf.last)>=840?'<p class="p3dnote">Caffeine after 2 pm can still be working at bedtime.</p>':''}</div>`:''}
      ${when}
      <div class="p3dbtns">${us.length?`<button type="button" class="${P3DS.fav?'on':''}" data-p3dfavs aria-expanded="${P3DS.fav}">${ico('star')} ${fv.length?'Favourites':'Your usual'} <small>${us.length}</small></button>`:''}<button type="button" class="${showB?'on':''}" data-p3dother aria-expanded="${showB}">+ Other coffee or tea</button></div>
      ${P3DS.fav&&us.length?`<div class="p3dfl">${us.map((x,i)=>`<button type="button" data-p3us="${i}"><span>${p3Pic(x.name,22)}</span><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><i>+</i></button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
      ${showB?`<div class="p3dbuild"><div class="p1cof">${COFFEE.map(x=>`<button type="button" data-cof="${x[0]}" aria-pressed="${P1C.type===x[0]}">${esc(x[1])}</button>`).join('')}</div>
        ${c?`<div class="field"><span class="label">Size</span>${p1Seg('cofsize',Object.entries(CSIZE).map(([v,s])=>[v,s[0]]),P1C.size)}</div>
          ${noMilk?'':`<div class="field"><span class="label">Milk</span><div class="p1cof p1cofm">${Object.entries(MILK).map(([v,m])=>`<button type="button" data-cofmilk="${v}" aria-pressed="${(P1C.milk||(c[3]?'semi':'none'))===v}">${m[0]}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`}
          ${/energy/.test(c[0])?'':`<div class="field"><span class="label">Sugar</span>${p1Seg('cofsugar',[['0','None'],['1','1 tsp'],['2','2 tsp']],String(P1C.sugar))}</div>`}
          <div class="p1cofsum num">${it.kcal} kcal · ${it.caffeine} mg caffeine</div><button type="button" class="primary" id="cofLog" style="width:100%">Log ${esc(it.name.toLowerCase())}</button>`:''}</div>`:''}
      <p class="p3dnote">${ico('check')} In your Food log too. Counted once.</p></div>`:''}</section>
  ${alcOn()?`<section class="p1blk p3dsec${P3DS.alc?' open':''}"><button type="button" class="p3dsh" data-p3dsec="alc" aria-expanded="${P3DS.alc}">${ico('wine')}<b>Alcohol</b><small class="num">${sdT?`${sdT} standard today`:'None today'} · ${wk} this week${lim?` of ${lim}`:''}</small>${p3Chev()}</button>
    ${P3DS.alc?`<div class="p3dbody">${alcT.length?`<div class="p3dlist">${(d.food||[]).map((x,ix)=>p3IsAlc(x)?`<div class="p1cafi p3dli"><span class="num">${esc(x.at||'')}</span><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><button type="button" class="x" data-del-food="${ix}" data-p1redraw aria-label="Remove">${ico('x')}</button></div>`:'').join('')}</div>`:''}<div class="p1cof">${ALC.map((a,i)=>`<button type="button" data-alc="${i}" data-p1redraw>${esc(a[0])}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`:''}</section>`:''}`)};
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const q=s=>e.target.closest&&e.target.closest(s);let x;if(!q('#p1Host'))return;
  if(x=q('[data-p3dsec]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();const s=x.dataset.p3dsec;if(s==='cof')P3DS.cof=!(P3DS.cof!=null?P3DS.cof:!!P1C.type);else P3DS.alc=!P3DS.alc;p1DrinksDraw();return}
  if(q('[data-p3dfavs]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();P3DS.fav=!P3DS.fav;if(P3DS.fav){P3DS.other=false;P1C.type=null}p1DrinksDraw();return}
  if(q('[data-p3dother]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();P3DS.other=!(P3DS.other||!!P1C.type);if(!P3DS.other)P1C.type=null;else P3DS.fav=false;p1DrinksDraw();return}
  if(x=q('[data-p3when]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();const m=+x.dataset.p3when;P1C.at=m?fmtT(((p1Min(p1Now())-m)%1440+1440)%1440):null;p1DrinksDraw();return}},true);

// ---- Food log: Drinks and Plants as tidy rows that open, like the meals ----
p3FoodDrinksHTML=function(k){const d=D()[k]||{};const its=(d.food||[]).map((x,ix)=>({...x,ix})).filter(p3IsDrink);const f=p3Fluid(d);let tg=3;try{tg=p1WaterTarget().lo}catch(e){}const pct=Math.round(f.t/tg*100);
  const caf=its.reduce((a,x)=>a+(+x.caffeine||0),0);
  return `<details class="card p3frow p3fdr"><summary><span class="p3fri" style="--ic:#4ea3d9">${ico('droplet')}</span><b>Drinks</b><span class="p3frv num">${f.t} of ${tg} L</span><span class="p3frp num">${pct}%</span>${p3Chev()}${p3Bar(pct,'#4ea3d9','fdr')}</summary>
    <div class="p3frb"><div class="p3fdrs num">Water ${Math.round(f.w*100)/100} L · other drinks ${f.o} L${f.s?` · shakes ${f.s} L`:''}${caf?` · ${Math.round(caf)} mg caffeine`:''}</div>
    ${its.length?`<div class="p3fdrl">${its.sort((a,b)=>String(a.at||'').localeCompare(String(b.at||''))).map(x=>`<div class="p3fdri"><span class="num">${esc(x.at||x.meal||'')}</span><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><small class="num">${p3IsAlc(x)?`${+x.sd||''} std`:`${p3DrinkMl(x)} ml`}</small></div>`).join('')}</div>`:'<p class="ds" style="margin:6px 0">No drinks logged yet.</p>'}
    <button type="button" class="ghost p3fopen" data-p3ring="drinks">Add a drink</button></div></details>`};
function p3PlantsRowHTML(k){const pw=plantsWeek(k),pt=plantsOn(D()[k]||{});const goal=typeof PLANTS_WEEK!=='undefined'?PLANTS_WEEK:30;const pct=Math.round(pw.size/goal*100);const cap=s=>s.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+s.slice(1);
  return `<details class="card p3frow p3fpl"><summary><span class="p3fri" style="--ic:#3e8a56">${ico('leaf')}</span><b>Plants</b><span class="p3frv num">${pw.size} of ${goal} this week</span><span class="p3frp num">${pt.size} today</span>${p3Chev()}${p3Bar(pct,'#3e8a56','fpl')}</summary>
    <div class="p3frb">${pt.size?`<span class="label">Today</span><div class="p3pch">${[...pt].map(p=>`<span>${esc(cap(p))}</span>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
    ${pw.size?`<span class="label">Last 7 days</span><div class="p3pch dim">${[...pw].filter(p=>!pt.has(p)).map(p=>`<span>${esc(cap(p))}</span>`).join('')}</div>`:'<p class="ds" style="margin:6px 0">Every different fruit, veg, bean, nut, seed, grain, herb and spice counts once a week.</p>'}
    <p class="ds" style="font-size:12px;margin:8px 0 0">30 different plants a week is linked with a healthier gut.</p></div></details>`}
p3FoodMode=(function(old){return function(){old();try{if(tab()!=='food'||fView!=='today')return;const app=document.getElementById('app');if(!app)return;const k=iso(sel);
  const pm=app.querySelector('details.p1pm');if(pm)pm.remove();
  const nav=app.querySelector('nav.p1nav');if(nav)nav.classList.add('p3even');
  if((P3FT.open||'tot')!=='tot')return;
  const pl=app.querySelector('.p1plants');if(pl&&!app.querySelector('.p3fpl')){pl.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',p3PlantsRowHTML(k));pl.remove()}
  const dr=app.querySelector('.p3fdr');if(dr&&!dr.classList.contains('p3frow')){dr.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',p3FoodDrinksHTML(k));dr.remove()}}catch(e){}}})(p3FoodMode);

// ---- header: date, messages, you. Goals live on the You page, food sign-off on the Food page ----
// ---- Plan page: Week / Month / Routes spread evenly; no "Session done" line above the session; moved/adjusted note under it ----
render=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);try{const app=document.getElementById('app');if(!app)return;
  const pn=app.querySelector('[data-pnav]');if(pn&&pn.parentElement)pn.parentElement.classList.add('p3even');
  if(tab()==='training'){const card=app.querySelector('article.card[style*="--c:"]');
    if(card){app.querySelectorAll('.stline.done').forEach(r=>{if(/Session done/.test(r.textContent))r.remove()});const adj=app.querySelector('.adjb');if(adj&&adj.compareDocumentPosition(card)&Node.DOCUMENT_POSITION_FOLLOWING)card.insertAdjacentElement('afterend',adj)}}
  // heart button leaves the Today row; it lives in the check-in now
  app.querySelectorAll('.p3act.p3heart').forEach(b=>b.remove())}catch(e){}}})(render);
// ---- Log a session: if today's plan is already done, just say so with a tick ----
p1MoveOpen=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);try{const k=iso(todayDate());const l=L()[k];const p=planFor(todayDate());let own=p&&p.adj&&(p.adj.type==='O'||p.adj.src==='own');try{if(!own&&p3Replaced(k))own=true}catch(z){}
  const b=document.querySelector('#p1Host [data-p1go="planned"]');if(!b)return;
  if(l&&(l.status==='done'||l.status==='partial')||own){b.classList.add('p3pdone');const sm=b.querySelector('small');if(sm)sm.innerHTML=`<span class="p3tick">${ico('check')}</span> ${own?'Done, your own session':l.status==='partial'?'Partly done':'Done'}`}}catch(e){}}})(p1MoveOpen);
// ---- morning pulse: a small optional line in the quick check-in instead of a button on Today ----
p1CiDraw=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);const c=P1.ci;if(!c||!c.quick)return;const host=document.querySelector('#p1Host .ksheet');if(!host||host.querySelector('.p3pulse'))return;
  const w=p3Wear();if(w&&w.status==='live')return;const h=(D()[c.k]||{}).hr;const sv=host.querySelector('#p1CiSave');if(!sv)return;
  sv.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',`<button type="button" class="p3pulse" data-p2hropen="${c.k}">${ico('heart-pulse')}<span>Morning pulse <small>optional</small></span><b class="num">${h&&h.bpm?h.bpm+' bpm':'Add ›'}</b></button>`)}})(p1CiDraw);

// ================= P3 (25 Nov eve): bars settle, compact coffee/tea builder, any time today, custom drinks, more alcohol, shake water, no food sign-off, alert badge on Food =================
// bars: grow once the first time you see them, then sit still at their value
const P3BS={};
p3Bar=function(pct,col,id){const first=id&&!P3BS[id];if(id)P3BS[id]=1;return `<div class="kfbar"><i class="${first?'grow':''}" style="width:${Math.max(0,Math.min(100,pct))}%;background:${col}"></i></div>`};
// sizes say their ml
const P3CML=t=>/espresso/.test(t)?{s:['Single','30 ml'],m:['Double','60 ml'],l:['Triple','90 ml']}:/energy/.test(t)?{s:['Small can','250 ml'],m:['Can','330 ml'],l:['Large can','500 ml']}:{s:['Small','180 ml'],m:['Medium','250 ml'],l:['Large','350 ml']};
// more alcohol, each with its size
[['Half pint of lager',1,108,9],['Can of beer 440 ml',1.5,180,14],['Bottle of cider 500 ml',2,210,24],['Small wine 125 ml',1.2,110,3],['Large wine 250 ml',2.5,230,6],['Bottle of wine 750 ml',7.5,690,18],['Prosecco 125 ml',1.2,90,2],['Double and mixer',2,200,20],['Cocktail',2,250,25],['Hard seltzer can',1.2,100,2],['Alcohol-free wine',0,30,7]].forEach(a=>{if(!ALC.some(x=>x[0]===a[0]))ALC.push(a)});
const p3RecentAlc=()=>{const seen=[];for(let i=0;i<30&&seen.length<3;i++){((D()[iso(addD(todayDate(),-i))]||{}).food||[]).filter(x=>x.src==='alcohol').forEach(x=>{const j=ALC.findIndex(a=>a[0]===x.name);if(j>=0&&!seen.includes(j)&&seen.length<3)seen.push(j)})}return seen};
addAlc=async function(i){const a=ALC[i];if(!a)return;const k=iso(todayDate());const now=new Date();const at=P1C.at||fmtT(now.getHours()*60+now.getMinutes());
  const it={name:a[0],qty:'1',meal:p1MealFor(at),at,est:true,src:'alcohol',sd:a[1],micros:false,plants:[]};NK.forEach(x=>it[x]=0);it.kcal=a[2];it.carbs=a[3];
  P3SKIP=true;await addFood([it],k);toast(`${a[0]} logged at ${at}`);P1C.at=null;if(document.querySelector('#p1Host .ksheet'))p1DrinksDraw();else render()};
// any time today: a row of times you scroll sideways, back to 5 am
function p3TimeRow(){const n=new Date();const now=n.getHours()*60+n.getMinutes();const ts=[];for(let m=Math.floor(now/15)*15;m>=300;m-=15)ts.push(fmtT(m));const cur=P1C.at||'';
  return `<div class="p3trow"><span>Had it</span><div class="p3hs">${`<button type="button" data-p3at="" aria-pressed="${!cur}">Now</button>`+ts.map(t=>`<button type="button" data-p3at="${t}" aria-pressed="${cur===t}">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`}
const P3CUS={text:'',busy:false,it:null,msg:''};
function p3CustomHTML(){const c=P3CUS;return `<div class="p3cus"><div class="p3cusr"><input type="text" id="p3cusT" maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. chai latte, yerba mate, matcha" value="${esc(c.text)}"><label class="p3cusp" aria-label="Photo of the drink or its box">${ico('camera')}<input type="file" accept="image/*" capture="environment" id="p3cusF" hidden></label></div>
  <button type="button" class="ghost" data-p3cusgo ${c.busy?'disabled':''} style="width:100%">${c.busy?'Working it out…':'Work out the caffeine'}</button>${c.msg?`<p class="p3dnote">${esc(c.msg)}</p>`:''}
  ${c.it?`<div class="p1cofsum num">${esc(c.it.name)} · ${c.it.ml||250} ml · ${Math.round(c.it.caffeine||0)} mg caffeine · ${Math.round(c.it.kcal||0)} kcal</div><button type="button" class="primary" data-p3cuslog style="width:100%">Log it</button>`:''}</div>`}
async function p3CustomRun(file){const c=P3CUS;if(!sample||(!c.text&&!file)){toast('Type the drink or take a photo');return}c.busy=true;c.msg='';p1DrinksDraw();
  try{const out=await sample.json(`${file?'This is a photo of a drink, a tea bag box or drink packaging.':`A drink: "${String(c.text).slice(0,80)}".`} Estimate one normal serving. Herbal and fruit teas have no caffeine; green tea, chai, matcha, yerba mate, guarana and energy drinks do. Reply ONLY JSON: {"name":"short name","ml":250,"caffeine":0,"kcal":0,"protein":0,"carbs":0,"fat":0,"sugar":0}`,file?{images:file}:{modelTier:'quick'});
    if(out&&out.name){c.it=out;c.msg=''}else c.msg='Could not work that one out. Try different words.'}catch(e){c.msg='Could not work that one out. Try again.'}c.busy=false;p1DrinksDraw()}
// the Drinks sheet again: logging first, then what you've had; every choice on one sideways row
p1DrinksDraw=function(){const k=iso(todayDate());const d=D()[k]||{};const f=p3Fluid(d);const tg=p1WaterTarget();const pct=Math.round(f.t/tg.lo*100);
  const cf=p1CafToday(k);const it=p1CofItem();const c=COFFEE.find(x=>x[0]===P1C.type);const noMilk=c&&/energy|espresso|herbal|green/.test(c[0]);
  const fv=dFavs();const us=fv.length?fv:p3Usuals();P3US=us;const n=cf.its.length;const cofOpen=P3DS.cof!=null?P3DS.cof:!!(P1C.type||P3DS.custom);const showB=P3DS.other||!!P1C.type||P3DS.custom;
  const alcT=(d.food||[]).map((x,ix)=>({...x,ix})).filter(p3IsAlc);const sdT=Math.round(alcT.reduce((a,x)=>a+(+x.sd||0),0)*10)/10;let wk=0,lim=0;try{wk=alcWeek(k);lim=alcLimit()}catch(e){}
  const keys=new Set(fv.map(x=>String(x.name).toLowerCase()));const ml=c?P3CML(c[0]):null;const ra=p3RecentAlc();
  const list=(arr,star)=>arr.length?`<div class="p3dlist"><span class="label">Today</span>${arr.map(x=>`<div class="p1cafi p3dli"><span class="num">${esc(x.at||'')}</span><b>${esc(x.name)}</b>${star?`<button type="button" class="p3dstar${keys.has(String(x.name).toLowerCase())?' on':''}" data-p3dfav="${x.ix}" aria-label="Favourite">${ico('star')}</button>`:'<span></span>'}<button type="button" class="x" data-del-food="${x.ix}" data-p1redraw aria-label="Remove">${ico('x')}</button></div>`).join('')}</div>`:'';
  p1Sheet(`<div class="kshead"><div><h2>Drinks</h2><small class="ds">Today</small></div><button type="button" class="x" id="p1X" aria-label="Close">${ico('x')}</button></div>
  <section class="p1blk p3dw"><div class="p3dwh"><span class="p3dwt">${ico('droplet')} Water</span><b class="num">${f.t}<small> of ${tg.lo} L</small></b><b class="num p3dwp">${pct}%</b></div>
    ${p3Bar(pct,'var(--k-sky,#4ea3d9)','dsheet')}
    <div class="p3dws">Water ${Math.round(f.w*100)/100} L · tea, coffee and other drinks ${f.o} L${f.s?` · shakes ${f.s} L`:''}${tg.why.length?` · more today: ${esc(tg.why.join(', '))}`:''}</div>
    <div class="p3dwb">${f.w>0?`<button type="button" class="p3dwm" data-p1w="-0.25" aria-label="Take off 250 ml">−</button>`:''}${[[.25,'250 ml','Glass'],[.5,'500 ml','Small bottle'],[.75,'750 ml','Bottle'],[1,'1 L','Litre']].map(([v,m,l])=>`<button type="button" data-p1w="${v}"><b>+${m}</b><small>${l}</small></button>`).join('')}</div></section>
  <section class="p1blk p3dsec${cofOpen?' open':''}"><button type="button" class="p3dsh" data-p3dsec="cof" aria-expanded="${cofOpen}">${ico('coffee')}<b>Coffee and tea</b><small class="num">${n?`${n} today · ${cf.tot} mg${cf.last?` · last ${esc(cf.last)}`:''}`:'None today'}</small>${p3Chev()}</button>
    ${cofOpen?`<div class="p3dbody">
      <div class="p3dbtns">${us.length?`<button type="button" class="${P3DS.fav?'on':''}" data-p3dfavs aria-expanded="${P3DS.fav}">${ico('star')} ${fv.length?'Favourites':'Your usual'} <small>${us.length}</small></button>`:''}<button type="button" class="${showB?'on':''}" data-p3dother aria-expanded="${showB}">+ Other</button></div>
      ${(P3DS.fav&&us.length)||showB?p3TimeRow():''}
      ${P3DS.fav&&us.length?`<div class="p3dfl">${us.map((x,i)=>`<button type="button" data-p3us="${i}"><span>${p3Pic(x.name,22)}</span><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><i>+</i></button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
      ${showB?`<div class="p3dbuild"><div class="p3hs">${COFFEE.map(x=>`<button type="button" data-cof="${x[0]}" aria-pressed="${P1C.type===x[0]}">${esc(x[1].split(' / ')[0])}</button>`).join('')}<button type="button" data-p3cus aria-pressed="${!!P3DS.custom}">${ico('camera')} Something else</button></div>
        ${P3DS.custom?p3CustomHTML():c?`<div class="p3hs">${Object.keys(CSIZE).map(v=>`<button type="button" data-p1="cofsize" data-v="${v}" aria-pressed="${P1C.size===v}">${ml[v][0]} <small>${ml[v][1]}</small></button>`).join('')}</div>
          ${noMilk?'':`<div class="p3hs">${Object.entries(MILK).map(([v,m])=>`<button type="button" data-cofmilk="${v}" aria-pressed="${(P1C.milk||(c[3]?'semi':'none'))===v}">${esc(m[0])}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}
          ${/energy/.test(c[0])?'':`<div class="p3hs">${[['0','No sugar'],['1','1 sugar'],['2','2 sugars']].map(([v,l])=>`<button type="button" data-p1="cofsugar" data-v="${v}" aria-pressed="${String(P1C.sugar)===v}">${l}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}
          <button type="button" class="primary p3coflog" id="cofLog">Log it<small class="num">${esc(it.name)} · ${it.caffeine} mg · ${it.kcal} kcal</small></button>`:''}</div>`:''}
      ${list(cf.its,true)}${cf.last&&p1Min(cf.last)>=840?'<p class="p3dnote">Caffeine after 2 pm can still be working at bedtime.</p>':''}
      <p class="p3dnote">${ico('check')} In your Food log too. Counted once.</p></div>`:''}</section>
  ${alcOn()?`<section class="p1blk p3dsec${P3DS.alc?' open':''}"><button type="button" class="p3dsh" data-p3dsec="alc" aria-expanded="${P3DS.alc}">${ico('wine')}<b>Alcohol</b><small class="num">${sdT?`${sdT} standard today`:'None today'} · ${wk} this week${lim?` of ${lim}`:''}</small>${p3Chev()}</button>
    ${P3DS.alc?`<div class="p3dbody">${p3TimeRow()}
      ${ra.length?`<div class="p3dfl">${ra.map(i=>`<button type="button" data-alc="${i}"><b>${esc(ALC[i][0])}</b><small class="num">${ALC[i][1]} std</small><i>+</i></button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
      <div class="p3agrid">${ALC.map((a,i)=>ra.includes(i)?'':`<button type="button" data-alc="${i}"><b>${esc(a[0])}</b><small class="num">${a[1]} std · ${a[2]} kcal</small></button>`).join('')}</div>
      ${list(alcT,false)}</div>`:''}</section>`:''}`)};
document.addEventListener('click',async e=>{const q=s=>e.target.closest&&e.target.closest(s);let x;if(!q('#p1Host'))return;
  if(x=q('[data-p3at]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();P1C.at=x.dataset.p3at||null;const row=x.closest('.p3hs');const sl=row?row.scrollLeft:0;p1DrinksDraw();const r2=document.querySelector('#p1Host .p3trow .p3hs');if(r2)r2.scrollLeft=sl;return}
  if(q('[data-p3cus]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();P3DS.custom=!P3DS.custom;if(P3DS.custom)P1C.type=null;p1DrinksDraw();return}
  if(q('[data-p3cusgo]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();const t=document.getElementById('p3cusT');P3CUS.text=t?t.value.trim():'';p3CustomRun(null);return}
  if(q('[data-p3cuslog]')){e.stopImmediatePropagation();const o=P3CUS.it;if(!o)return;const n=new Date();const at=P1C.at||fmtT(n.getHours()*60+n.getMinutes());
    const it={name:o.name,qty:`${o.ml||250} ml`,at,meal:p1MealFor(at),src:'coffee',est:true,micros:false,plants:[]};NK.forEach(z=>it[z]=0);['caffeine','kcal','protein','carbs','fat','sugar'].forEach(z=>{if(isNum(o[z]))it[z]=+o[z]});
    P3SKIP=true;await addFood([it],k0());toast(`${o.name} logged at ${at}`);Object.assign(P3CUS,{text:'',it:null,msg:''});P3DS.custom=false;P1C.at=null;p1DrinksDraw();return}
  if(x=q('[data-cof]')){P3DS.custom=false}},true);
const k0=()=>iso(todayDate());
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target.id==='p3cusF'&&e.target.files&&e.target.files[0]){p3CustomRun(e.target.files[0])}});
// logging a drink keeps the time you picked until it's saved, then goes back to Now
window.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('#cofLog,[data-p3us]'))setTimeout(()=>{P1C.at=null},800)},false);

// shakes and electrolytes: show the water assumed, and let it go up or down
p3SuppMl=function(d){let ml=0;try{supps().forEach(s=>{if(!p3Took(d,s))return;ml+=p3SuppWater(d,s)})}catch(e){}return ml};
function p3SuppBase(s){const t=`${s.name||''} ${s.dose||''}`.toLowerCase();if(/electrolyte|hydro|hydration|rehydrat|nuun|dioralyte/.test(t))return 500;if(/protein|whey|shake|mass gainer|recovery drink|casein/.test(t))return 300;return 0}
function p3SuppWater(d,s){const o=d&&d.suppMl&&d.suppMl[s.id];if(isNum(o))return +o;return p3SuppBase(s)*p3SQ(d,s.id)}
suppHTML=(function(old){return function(k){let h=old(k);const l=supps();const d=D()[k]||{};const t=document.createElement('template');t.innerHTML=h;
  t.content.querySelectorAll('[data-supp]').forEach(b=>{const s=l.find(x=>x.id===b.dataset.supp);if(!s||!b.classList.contains('on')||!p3SuppBase(s))return;b.classList.add('p3swrap');
    b.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<span class="p3sml">Mixed with <span class="p3sqb" data-supml="${s.id}:-1" role="button" aria-label="Less water">−</span><b class="num">${p3SuppWater(d,s)} ml</b><span class="p3sqb" data-supml="${s.id}:1" role="button" aria-label="More water">+</span> water</span>`)});return t.innerHTML}})(suppHTML);
window.addEventListener('click',async e=>{const x=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('[data-supml]');if(!x)return;e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();const k=iso(sel);const d=D()[k]||{};const [id,dir]=x.dataset.supml.split(':');const s=supps().find(z=>z.id===id);if(!s)return;
  const v=Math.max(0,Math.min(2000,p3SuppWater(d,s)+100*(+dir)));await persistDay(k,{suppMl:{...(d.suppMl||{}),[id]:v}});render()},true);

// food sign-off: not needed. A day with food is closed by itself the next day, and editing never needs it again
let P3SO=false;
render=(function(old){return function(){old.apply(this,arguments);try{const app=document.getElementById('app');if(!app)return;
  app.querySelectorAll('#signOpen').forEach(b=>{const r=b.closest('.stline');(r||b).remove()});
  app.querySelectorAll('.stline').forEach(r=>{if(/signed off|Sign off when|Finished eating/i.test(r.textContent))r.remove()});
  if(!P3SO&&!sampleMode){P3SO=true;for(let i=1;i<=7;i++){const k=iso(addD(todayDate(),-i));const d=D()[k];if(d&&(d.food||[]).length&&!d.foodDone)persistDay(k,{foodDone:true})}}
  // nutrition alerts become a badge on the Food ring
  const w=app.querySelector('.p3act.p3warn');const ring=app.querySelector('[data-p3ring="food"]');
  if(w){const m=(w.getAttribute('aria-label')||'').match(/^(\d+)/);const n=m?+m[1]:1;w.remove();if(ring&&!ring.querySelector('.p3rbadge')){ring.style.position='relative';ring.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<span class="p3rbadge" role="button" aria-label="${n} nutrition alert${n>1?'s':''}">${n}</span>`)}}
  const acts=app.querySelector('.p3acts');if(acts&&!acts.querySelector('button,a'))acts.remove()}catch(e){}}})(render);
window.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.p3rbadge');if(!b)return;e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();const t=document.createElement('button');t.dataset.p3warn='';t.hidden=true;document.getElementById('app').appendChild(t);t.click();t.remove()},true);
// ================= the "5 logged" strip: pick your own five =================
const P3L5POOL=[['ci','Check in','sun'],['food','2+ meals','utensils'],['water','Water','droplet'],['move','Session','footprints'],['phone','Phone away','moon'],['bed','Bed on time','moon'],['protein','Protein','beef'],['plants','5 plants','leaf'],['supps','Supplements','pill'],['nodrink','No alcohol','glass-water'],['recover','Recovery','waves']];
let p3L5Ids=()=>{const m=meta.log5&&Array.isArray(meta.log5.ids)?meta.log5.ids.filter(id=>P3L5POOL.some(p=>p[0]===id)):null;return m&&m.length>=3?m.slice(0,5):['ci','food','water','move','phone']};
p3Log5=(function(old){return function(k){const base=old(k);const d=D()[k]||{};const by={};base.forEach(x=>by[x.id]=x);const P=id=>P3L5POOL.find(p=>p[0]===id);
  const mk=(id,done,a)=>({id,l:P(id)[1],ic:P(id)[2],done,a});
  return p3L5Ids().map(id=>{if(by[id])return by[id];try{
    if(id==='bed')return mk(id,habDone('bed',k),'data-p1tile="ci"');
    if(id==='nodrink')return mk(id,habDone('nodrink',k)||!(d.food||[]).some(x=>x.src==='alcohol')&&k<iso(todayDate()),'data-p3l5t="nodrink"');
    if(id==='protein'){const t=nutTarget('protein',dayTypeFor(k)).t||0;return mk(id,t>0&&foodTotals(d).protein>=t*.9,'data-p3ring="food"')}
    if(id==='plants')return mk(id,plantsOn(d).size>=5,'data-p3ring="food"');
    if(id==='supps'){const l=supps();return mk(id,l.length>0&&l.every(s=>p3Took(d,s)),'data-p3ring="food"')}
    if(id==='recover')return mk(id,(d.recovery||[]).length>0,'data-p1tile="rec"')}catch(e){}return mk(id,false,'')})}})(p3Log5);
